---

<Layout
  title="Fender Serial Number Lookup: Free Decoder & Dating Guide"
  description="Free Fender serial number lookup - decode any American, Mexican, Japanese, or Custom Shop serial from 1950 to present. Expert dating guide."
  canonical="/fender-guitars-serial-number-guide/"
  ogImage={`${SITE_URL}${fsnImg("fender-bridge-plate-serial-number-1024x683.jpg")}`}
  ogImageAlt="The bridge plate serial number on an iconic 1952 Fender Telecaster"
  ogType="article"
  publishedTime="2026-03-12T20:42:57+00:00"
  modifiedTime="2026-05-14T19:40:30+00:00"
  structuredData={[articleSchema, breadcrumbSchema, faqSchema, toolSchema, webPageSchema, ogImageSchema]}
>
  <!-- Header backdrop: dark brown band so the (transparent) site Header has a
       solid surface to sit on, then a cream band so the secondary nav row
       reads as a white pill. The site Header is `position:absolute` over this. -->
